WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.250
You already have the training. It's sitting in your PowerPoint decks.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.000
Start a new course from those decks, right in SafelyTrack.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.050
Drop in the decks you already teach from, and tell it how long the course should run.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:24.850
Each deck becomes a module: short teaching slides, each with a picture, and a narrated script written from your speaker notes.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.100
When it's done, it tells you exactly where to look first.

00:00:31.317 --> 00:00:36.017
Your own jobsite photos are kept, and sharpened to fill the slide.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:42.200
And every slide traces back to the deck, and the speaker notes, it came from.

00:00:43.217 --> 00:00:46.717
Learners get a self-paced course, with a voice on every slide.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.967
Send your client a review link. No login needed.

00:00:57.217 --> 00:01:01.067
When it's right, publish it, with completion tracking built in.

00:01:02.217 --> 00:01:08.067
Your decks in. A course out. Book a demo, and see it work on your own decks.

